that, wow, I can do this.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.053
I can make someone take their shoes off.

00:07:55.053 --> 00:07:56.182
- (fingers snapping) In that moment.

00:07:56.182 --> 00:07:57.015
- In that moment.

00:07:57.015 --> 00:07:58.120
- You can get somebody into your world.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:58.953
- Yes.

00:07:58.953 --> 00:08:00.440
